# Unity generated folders (for the dev project under src/protobuf-unity)
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/

# The unanchored folder rules above (e.g. [Bb]uild/, [Ll]ogs/) match at any depth,
# so force-commit the dev project's tracked folders in case the package ever contains
# a same-named subfolder.
!/src/protobuf-unity/Assets/**
!/src/protobuf-unity/Packages/**
!/src/protobuf-unity/ProjectSettings/**

# Asset meta data should only be ignored when the corresponding asset is also ignored
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

# Autogenerated project files
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.user

# OS / IDE
.DS_Store
.vs/
.idea/

# Unity package samples live in a folder literally named `Samples~`. A global
# ignore of `*~` (common for editor backup files) would otherwise swallow the
# whole folder, so force it back in. Same for other Unity `~` package folders.
!Samples~/
!**/Samples~/
!Documentation~/
!**/Documentation~/
